**Calculation :**

&rArr; &ang;DAC = &ang;ACB (Alternate angle)

&rArr; &ang;AOB + &ang;BOC = 180&deg; 

&rArr; &ang;BOC = 110&deg; 

Now, &ang;BOC + &ang;OBC + &ang;OCB = 180&deg; 

&rArr; &ang;OBC =  180&deg; - 110&deg; - 32&deg; 

&rArr; &ang;OBC = 38&deg; 

&rArr; &ang;OBC = &ang;DBC = 38&deg; 

Now, 2y + 15&deg; = 2 × 38&deg; + 15&deg; = 76&deg; + 15&deg; = 91&deg; 

**&there4; The correct answer is 91&deg;**

